### Ticket Service API Tests
### Make sure to replace {{token}} with your actual Keycloak JWT token

### Health Check
GET http://localhost:8084/actuator/health

### Get all tickets
GET http://localhost:8084/api/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get ticket by ID
GET http://localhost:8084/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a new ticket with VALID department ID (IT Support)
POST http://localhost:8084/api/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Unable to login to the system
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

I cannot login to the helpdesk system. Getting "Invalid credentials" error even with correct password.
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="type"

PROBLEM
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="departementId"

694f2cda7ddba34f0f4b5818
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="priority"

HIGH
--boundary--

### Create a ticket with INVALID department ID (should fail)
POST http://localhost:8084/api/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Test with Invalid Department
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

This should fail because department ID doesn't exist in MongoDB
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="type"

PROBLEM
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="departementId"

692b603f9bdb41da41eb17ee
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="priority"

HIGH
--boundary--

### Update ticket
PUT http://localhost:8084/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Updated Title
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

Updated description
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="priority"

CRITICAL
--boundary--

### Update ticket status
PATCH http://localhost:8084/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/status?status=IN_PROGRESS&comment=Working on it
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Assign ticket
PATCH http://localhost:8084/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/assign?assigneeId=user123
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Review ticket (accept)
POST http://localhost:8084/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/review?accept=true&comment=Approved
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Review ticket (reject)
POST http://localhost:8084/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/review?accept=false&comment=Need more information
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Resubmit ticket
POST http://localhost:8084/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/resubmit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Revised ticket title
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

Added more details as requested
--boundary--

### Transfer ticket
PATCH http://localhost:8084/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/transfer?newAssigneeId=user456
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Upload solution
POST http://localhost:8084/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/solution
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="solution.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./solution.pdf
--boundary--

### Download attachment
GET http://localhost:8084/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/attachment
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Download solution
GET http://localhost:8084/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/solution
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get ticket history
GET http://localhost:8084/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/history
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get my tickets
GET http://localhost:8084/api/tickets/my-tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get my tickets by status
GET http://localhost:8084/api/tickets/my-tickets?status=IN_PROGRESS
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get assigned tickets
GET http://localhost:8084/api/tickets/assigned
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get assigned tickets by status
GET http://localhost:8084/api/tickets/assigned/IN_PROGRESS
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete ticket
DELETE http://localhost:8084/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
